00:25:54,580 --> 00:26:01,040
With that said, as you start scaling, and once you get to bigger audiences, and you do have people coming back and purchasing over and over again,

266
00:26:01,040 --> 00:26:07,460
I would highly recommend removing the view-through attribution, and if you want to test engaged-view, you can keep it on.

267
00:26:07,640 --> 00:26:14,900
But for a lot of our brands, we're also just removing this as well, because what we're looking for is just people who are actually clicking the ads, cuz we found that that's been a lot

